# the tables the redrawn Supplementary Figures S1-S7 read (cnsfig.cache, the
# evening of 2026-09-15; directories at the printed numbers since 2026-09-16,
# when S1 was split into S1 and S2 and S2-S9 became S3-S10): QC metrics of a 30,000-cell subsample, per-sample box
# statistics and cell-type proportions named by study ID, two UMAPs of the same
# subsample, a doublet-score histogram, dot-plot mean/fraction frames, metaprogram
# loadings, Kaplan-Meier survival functions of public TCGA cases, per-cell UMAP
# positions with one expression value, module proportions and CD274 means by
# group - and one MANIFEST.csv of md5s per directory. 6.9 MB; every file scanned
# with scan_publish_safety.py, no hit.
